%% One order's journey through all six patterns.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Client
    participant API as order-api (Go)
    participant AMB as cache-ambassador (Go)
    participant SH as cache-shards (redis x3)
    participant ADP as metrics-adapter (Py)
    participant LOG as log-shipper → sink
    participant ROOT as inventory-root (Go)
    participant LP as leaf-py (us-east)
    participant LN as leaf-node (us-west)
    participant MRG as inventory-merge (Py)
    participant CO as coordinator (Go)
    participant WF as worker: framework+stage
    participant SET as settlement (leader)

    C->>API: POST /orders
    Note over API,LOG: SIDECAR + ADAPTER run passively on every request
    API->>AMB: GET cart:cust (localhost:6380)
    AMB->>SH: routed to one shard by crc32
    API-->>ADP: native stats on :9000 (scraped, normalized to :9102)
    API-->>LOG: append JSONL to shared volume (shipped centrally)

    rect rgb(245,245,255)
    Note over API,MRG: SCATTER / GATHER - fan out, gather one verdict
    API->>ROOT: POST /availability
    par concurrent, siblings not cancelled
        ROOT->>LP: /shard/availability
    and
        ROOT->>LN: /shard/availability
    end
    ROOT->>MRG: POST partials
    MRG-->>API: {fulfillable, partial, allocation}
    end

    rect rgb(245,255,245)
    Note over API,WF: WORK QUEUE - durable handoff, file-in/file-out stage
    API->>CO: POST /enqueue {order_id,...}
    CO-->>API: {task_id}
    API-->>C: 201 {order_id, task_id, availability}
    CO->>WF: RPUSH ready
    WF->>WF: BLMOVE claim, write in/order.json, stage writes out/result.json, ack
    WF->>SET: SADD settle:pending order_id
    end

    rect rgb(255,250,240)
    Note over SET: LEADER ELECTION - only the elected replica finalizes
    SET->>SET: finalize order:id (idempotent, once)
    end
